13
00:01:00.211 --> 00:01:05.977
Responsible technical communication
distinguishes claims from evidence.

14
00:01:05.977 --> 00:01:15.115
Consider this worked case: A paper stating
'Our algorithm reduces latency by 15%' must

15
00:01:15.115 --> 00:01:20.336
