23
00:01:54.267 --> 00:02:01.877
), writing styles of computer scientists,
document readability and usability, documents

24
00:02:01.877 --> 00:02:09.488
for career readiness, effective presentations,
teamwork and peer review, research methods,

25
00:02:09.488 --> 00:02:15.715
experimentation, documenting mathematics and
