30
00:02:35.704 --> 00:02:43.501
Follow every arrow in order and name the state
before and after each transition.

31
00:02:43.501 --> 00:02:49.032
The trace converts an abstract statement into
an inspectable sequence.

32
00:02:49.154 --> 00:02:56.934
Next, compare the choices involved in Research
Methods and Reproducibility and make the

33
00:02:56.934 --> 00:02:58.729
